# libFuzzer flags for fuzz_ldtk, one a line: tools/fuzz.sh run and merge pass them.
# The seeds are small projects written for one part of the reader each (fields,
# tiles, IntGrid, worlds, a level in its own file) plus minimal.ldtk and two
# samples cut to one level: 8 KB holds every one whole, and keeps the merged
# corpus small (tests/campaign_test.py holds the whole corpus under 2 MB).
-max_len=8192
